💥Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard

Overview

The Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard is a data analytics project built to analyze sales performance, revenue trends, profitability, product performance, category performance, and regional sales.

The project transforms raw sales data into meaningful business insights using Python-based data analysis and visualization.

Objectives

- Analyze overall sales and revenue performance
- Measure profitability and profit margin
- Identify high-performing product categories
- Analyze regional sales performance
- Identify top-performing products
- Understand monthly revenue trends
- Examine the relationship between discounts, sales, and profit
- Generate actionable business insights

Key Analysis

Sales & Revenue

- Total revenue
- Total profit
- Total quantity sold
- Total orders
- Average order value

Trend Analysis

- Monthly revenue trends
- Sales performance over time

Product Analysis

- Top products by revenue
- Product-level sales performance

Category Analysis

- Revenue by category
- Profit by category

Regional Analysis

- Revenue by region
- Regional performance comparison

Profitability Analysis

- Overall profit margin
- Profit performance across categories
- Discount and profitability analysis

Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Kaggle Notebook

